# Compact Analysis tab header

Shorten the Production/Plans selector and place the Graph and Help actions to its right.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Production and Plans remain a two-option selector with clear selected state.
- [ ] The selector no longer consumes the full available width.
- [ ] Graph and Help appear to the right of the selector in the same header row.
- [ ] Graph and Help retain separate non-overlapping hit targets and independent pressed states.
- [ ] Tapping either action cannot activate the other action or change the selected tab.
- [ ] The player selector remains below the header.
- [ ] The layout fits supported compact iPhone widths without clipping or wrapping.
- [ ] UI regression coverage compiles.
- [ ] Focused compact-width checks pass on a functioning simulator or device.
